{
 "plan": {
  "title": "Donation Dashboard",
  "subtitle": "Overview of monthly trends, top cities, payment modes, and repeat donors",
  "panels": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "kind": "line",
    "title": "Monthly Donation Trend",
    "sql": "SELECT \"Date\" AS month, SUM(\"Amount\") AS total FROM donor_transactions GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1",
    "x": "month",
    "y": [
     "total"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "kind": "bar",
    "title": "Top Cities by Donation Amount",
    "sql": "SELECT \"City\", SUM(\"Amount\") AS total_amount FROM donor_transactions GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 5",
    "x": "City",
    "y": [
     "total_amount"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "kind": "bar",
    "title": "Donation Amount by Payment Mode",
    "sql": "SELECT \"Mode\", SUM(\"Amount\") AS total_amount FROM donor_transactions GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC",
    "x": "Mode",
    "y": [
     "total_amount"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "kind": "kpi",
    "title": "Number of Repeat Donors",
    "sql": "SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT \"Donor\") AS repeat_donors FROM (SELECT \"Donor\", COUNT(*) AS donations FROM donor_transactions GROUP BY 1 HAVING COUNT(*) > 1) AS subquery",
    "unit": ""
   }
  ],
  "narrative": "The donation dashboard provides insights into the monthly donation trends, highlighting the total donations received each month. The top cities contributing to donations are displayed, showcasing the cities with the highest donation amounts. Additionally, the dashboard breaks down the donation amounts by payment mode, offering a clear view of the preferred payment methods. Lastly, the number of repeat donors is presented, indicating the donors who have contributed more than once."
 },
